  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Mid-term review of the Viet Nam Energy Partnership Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The main objectives of this evaluation are to provide the relevant services of the European Union, the VEPG Steering Committee and selected interested stakeholders with:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;an overall independent assessment of the past performance of the Viet Nam Energy Partnership Group (VEPG)&lt;em&gt;,&lt;/em&gt; paying particular attention to its `intermediate&#xbf; results measured against its expected objectives; and the reasons underpinning such results;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;key lessons learned, conclusions and related recommendations in order to improve current and future performance of the VEPG&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In particular, this evaluation will serve to understand the performance of the VEPG, its enabling and hindering factors in order to adjust its design/processes/activities, as well as to inform the planning of the future EU support to the VEPG. The results of the evaluation will be presented to the Steering Committee of the VEPG. The recommendations should be practical, e.g. including suggestions to revise the ToR of the VEPG or the ToR of the VEPG TWGs or to adjust specific processes within the VEPG dialogue.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
